    "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:12:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-11T06:12:09Z",
    "body": "OK, discussed with @karlcow today and we decided the simplest thing to do for now is mark this as non-normative. I think having this be one day normative would be useful, but it's going to be more work and we'll probably want to add some additional machinery to fetch to at least allow for per-request user-agent values (given the existence of quirks and UA overrides), and we'll have to modify things here to account for embedders like Opera, which are probably using a navigator compatibility mode of Chrome, but don't send the Chrome-UA.",
